WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.083 --> 00:00:02.833
- In the beforetimes, everyone stayed here, in the pocket. 

00:00:03.208 --> 00:00:06.625
Quarterbacks were slow, respected, and allowed to be wrong every now and then.

00:00:06.916 --> 00:00:07.791
- Dang, another pick.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:08.708
- We've got more picks
- We’ve got plenty.

00:00:08.875 --> 00:00:12.666
- RRRAUGHHH... THE AVERAGE QB HAS 2.7 SECONDS
IN THE POCKET RAUGHHHHH

00:00:12.833 --> 00:00:14.083
- Rushers! RUN!

00:00:14.583 --> 00:00:15.250
- Don’t you get it?

00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:16.625
We can't.

00:00:16.625 --> 00:00:19.125
- Razor! Razor! Who's the Mike, who's the Mike?
- Hut, audible! Hut, one, two. 
- Uh, uh, Omaha!

00:00:19.583 --> 00:00:22.875
- Sammy, you know I’m a cornfed passer, but you ever think there’s 
a world outside this here pocket?

00:00:23.166 --> 00:00:25.583
- If I think about my circumstances, I cry.

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:26.916
- Swamp Cat need to purr.

00:00:27.458 --> 00:00:30.791
- Oh no, my ghost vision sixth sense! Warn the guards!

00:00:31.291 --> 00:00:33.458
- You know, a real good show would be about us offensive lineman.

00:00:33.458 --> 00:00:34.583
- Yes Elgton Jenkins—

00:00:35.875 --> 00:00:36.416
- So the problem is—

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:38.666
- [Together:] Nobody notices when we DON’T let people in. 

00:00:38.791 --> 00:00:39.250
- Yeah.

00:00:39.375 --> 00:00:41.500
- Dear Mom and Dad, I’m not enjoying camp anymore. 

00:00:41.583 --> 00:00:42.291
Pick me up. 

00:00:42.875 --> 00:00:44.833
- I have a big lead, so I'm probably not going to make it. 

00:00:44.916 --> 00:00:46.583
Find the disciples of Vick!

00:00:46.750 --> 00:00:47.708
- ALL RIGHT! BYE, Y'ALL.

00:00:48.208 --> 00:00:50.583
- I'm sweating more than a linebacker at Sunday morning service.

00:00:50.916 --> 00:00:51.625
Sweet Bojangles!

00:00:52.208 --> 00:00:54.333
- My leg arms are as good as my top arms!

00:00:54.375 --> 00:00:55.833
- The whole world is a pocket to me!

00:00:56.083 --> 00:00:56.708
- Yo, fam. What up?

00:00:56.875 --> 00:00:59.000
- Thank you…running backs?

00:00:59.041 --> 00:00:59.875
- Bruh, still?

00:01:02.625 --> 00:01:05.166
- I’m more tired than butter on a city slicker’s biscuit!

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:08.000
Sheesh! I’m as tired as a hog workin’ a double shift!

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:11.083
I’m more tired than a coyote at a carnival!

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:13.875
I’m more tired than a gator on a rollercoaster!

00:01:14.833 --> 00:01:16.625
I’m more tired than a banjo on a bayou!

00:01:17.666 --> 00:01:19.666
I ran faster than one of them Gridiron Heights cartoons!

